<title>USA: IES Utilities Iowa nuke rises to 12 pct.</title>
<headline>IES Utilities Iowa nuke rises to 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>IES Utilities Inc's 538 megawatt (MW) Duane Arnold nuclear unit is in startup and operating at 12 percent power early Thursday, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said in its plant status report.</p>
<p>The unit, in Palo, Iowa, was taken off line last Friday to repair a well water leak in the containment cooling system.</p>
<p>IES Utilities is a subsidiary of IES Industries Inc.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
